<title>USA: Odetics says wins patent appeal.</title>
<headline>Odetics says wins patent appeal.</headline>
<dateline>ANAHEIM, Calif. 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Odetics Inc said Friday it won its patent appeal against Storage Technology Corp.</p>
<p>The appeal was decided in the United States Court of Appeals for the Federal Circuit. The court vacated a lower court's findings of noninfringement and remanded the case for consideration.</p>
<p>Odetics contends Storage Technology's  automated tape-library system products violates its patent.</p>
<p>Storage Technology was not immediately available for comment.</p>
</text>
